-theme-remove has a theme it can remove. omarchy-theme-removable names those themes: the directories under ~/.config/omarchy/themes that are not symlinks or dot-directories. The row asks the helper as its when:, and the remover reads its list from it. Until the batch answers, the menu draws the previous answers, as for every guarded row."}],"intentEdits":1,"linkedIssues":["#14150"],"sources":["changeRequest.body","changeRequest.linkedIssues","changeRequest.title","requirement:SW-REQ-261003-390Z"],"status":"declared","title":"Only offer Remove > Theme when there is a theme to remove"},"nextDecision":{"disclosureIds":["compat_change_unapproved:cf-009b30ef45d5263b","compat_change_unapproved:cf-38d7ee3bf9d38d06","compat_change_unapproved:cf-5d7f744792e666a7","compat_change_unapproved:cf-6181f138ac1ffa7e","compat_change_unapproved:cf-7badf1745f435b63","compat_change_unapproved:cf-b47becf5dc3265b1","compat_change_unapproved:cf-c7bcb7c2e122d885","compat_change_unapproved:cf-fd5dd9c0fe225841"],"kind":"human_judgement","question":"Approve each of the 8 backward-compatibility changes: a reviewer or above approves it, or the author fixes it.","reason":"compat_changes_unapproved"},"preservedBehaviour":{"requirements":[{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-2JZT","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-47T8","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-47T8"],"title":"The rewrite touches only the plain $(reader) form, mapping it to the captured slot. command -v reader, VAR=x reader, and every other form runs the real command."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-3T3F","matchLevel":"file","obligations":["boundary","error_handling","input_domain"],"parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-PPDW","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-PPDW"],"title":"Unparseable input (after stripping), non-object JSON, and non-object entries yield an empty or skipped item set; no exception escapes the parser."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-46HY","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-PPDW","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-PPDW"],"title":"An entry with action is an action, with target a link, otherwise a menu. An undeclared parent derives from the dotted id (or root). Root's parent is empty."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-74BZ","matchLevel":"file","obligations":["boundary"],"parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ"],"title":"A route matching no id and no alias resolves to the literal input. A misspelling still attempts to open that id without a rewrite."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-7NPE","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-PPDW","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-PPDW"],"title":"A user entry overrides the default per key while keeping the row's original order slot. The model injects a root item with label Go when no source declares one."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-CYB9","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ"],"title":"Absent an exact id, a route equal to a declared alias resolves to the id of the item declaring the alias. Alias comparison lowercases and maps underscores to dashes."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-DQ9P","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-V7W6","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-V7W6"],"title":"A row matches only when every query term appears in its name text (label, leaf id, aliases) or as a whole word in its description. Invisible and disabled rows never match."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-E4J2","matchLevel":"file","obligations":["input_domain"],"parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-PPDW","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-PPDW"],"title":"The parser strips full-line // comments and trailing commas before JSON parsing, so the authored JSONC parses to its declared entries."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-EFNR","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-0M8A","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-0M8A"],"title":"swapProviderRows drops exactly the rows carrying the re-run provider's providerMenu and appends the new batch, leaving static children and other providers' rows untouched."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-JRW1","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-47T8","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-47T8"],"title":"Applied guard results drive the view. A row hides when its when: is false. A static submenu or link hides when no descendant is visible, while provider-backed menus stay visible. A checked:true or disabled:true row earns the check-mark label. A disabled row dims and skips the cursor."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-MQ37","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-47T8","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-47T8"],"title":"The generated guard script holds exactly one if-line per declared when, checked, or disabled, each echoing <id>:<w|c|d>:<0|1>; items with no guard get none."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-N3RM","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ","SYS-REQ-260927-WC89"],"title":"When a route resolves to an action item with a non-empty action, the action runs directly and no menu opens."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-PRNV","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ"],"title":"An exact id match wins over every alias. App rows are never routable, so an installed app's keywords cannot shadow a menu route (htop ships Keywords=system)."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-RGCV","matchLevel":"file","obligations":["error_handling"],"parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-47T8","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-47T8"],"title":"The prelude's omarchy-pkg-present/missing shadows agree with pacman -Q everywhere. This covers provides resolution, version constraints deferred to pacman, and the no-argument case (present true of nothing, missing not)."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-SJ7P","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-V7W6","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-V7W6"],"title":"Scores tier exact label, whole-word app name, label prefix, label substring, name text, then description. Menus and links promote by 2, apps demote by 5 within a tier. Final order breaks ties by depth then declaration order."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-TKDP","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-V7W6","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-V7W6"],"title":"Search lists current-menu matches before deeper (drilldown) matches, with a divider section exactly when both groups are non-empty."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-W17G","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-47T8","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-47T8"],"title":"A value command shared by several guards (e.g. omarchy-default-browser across seven rows) runs once per batch, captured eagerly before any guard line."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-XW52","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ"],"title":"When a route resolves to a link item, the menu opens at the link's target."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-Y58B","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-47T8","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-47T8"],"title":"When no item declares a guard, the guard script is empty and no guard process runs."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-Z680","matchLevel":"file","obligations":["atomicity"],"parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-0M8A","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-0M8A"],"title":"mergeAppRows and swapProviderRows return fresh maps that drop orphan ids and the replaced batch. They list a duplicated incoming id once and never write into their input maps."},{